  "event:evt.gen_48.joseph_told_of_illness": {
   "status": "approved",
   "produced_by": {
    "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
    "skill": "urim-chronologist@5",
    "run": "main"
   },
   "produced_at": "2026-11-02T14:02:07+00:00",
   "agent_notes": [
    "'After these things' gives no interval. Anchored on the oath of 47:29-31 (c. 1860 BCE, the 17th year in Egypt) with a one-month offset and a wide margin of three months; Jacob dies at 147 (47:28), so the visit falls within the last year. Tier REGNAL_YEAR because the scene falls under the age framing of 47:28; the month itself is a guess.",
    "The travel time between Joseph's residence and Goshen is not given and no coordinates are available for either; one day for the message and the journey is an estimate, with a margin of a day."
   ],
   "history": [
    {
     "status": "approved",
     "at": "2026-11-02T14:03:18+00:00",
     "note": null,
     "by": "urim-critic@3 · claude-opus-5-5"
    }
   ],
   "source": null
  }
 },
